    "title": "Biblia Nueva Traducci\u00f3n",
    "description": "Free Download New Living Translation Bible, also called the Holy Bible. A new translation of the Bible, fruit of the work of a large team of translators, theologians and linguists in order to create a version for contemporary readers of the Bible.\r\n\r\nThe Bible is the Word of God and was originally written in Hebrew, Greek and Aramaic. Today, there are many versions of the Bible in Spanish, Catholic and Protestant, including the King James 1960, the New International Version, the Jerusalem Bible, the King James Version and many more.\r\n\r\nThe great challenge of the New Living Translation was to achieve a current language version, while maintaining the essence of the message contained in the original languages \u200b\u200bof the Bible.\r\n\r\nNow you can enjoy it on your Android phone or tablet, even without being connected to Internet. It is a Bible that works offline and brings the audio function.\r\n\r\nYou can listen to all the verses in high quality audio, and other multiple functions:\r\n\r\n1) free, audio and offline\r\n\r\nDownload it for free on Google Play and always have it on your phone. Carry the Word of God everywhere and read anywhere, even if you have no internet network at your fingertips.\r\nTo hear the verse you are reading, press the audio icon. Settings, adjust the volume, tone and speed of voice, if desired.\r\n\r\n2) Mark and save verses\r\n\r\nYou can easily mark the verses that most impact and save them to a favorites list sorted by date to access it whenever you need it.\r\n\r\n3) Notes\r\n\r\nAdd notes, customize your Bible.\r\n\r\n4) Text Size\r\n\r\nYou can quickly increase or decrease the font size of the text if needed. You have 7 options to choose from.\r\n\r\n5) Send verses\r\n\r\nYou can send verses via SMS; WhatsApp or email, and easily share them on social networks.\r\nHelp us to spread the Word of God each time more Christians!\r\n\r\n6) day / night mode\r\n\r\nEasily switch from one to another for easier reading.\r\nIf you read at night or in low-light, activate night mode that darkens the screen and makes reading much easier. His eyes will thank you and your sleep will be more restful.\r\n\r\n7) Easy navigation between books and chapters of the Bible and keyword search.\r\n\r\nAll these resources and more, can be used without internet connection.\r\n\r\nIt's the perfect Bible for you! Download now and share the Word of God with his family and friends.\r\n\r\nNew Living Translation Bible consists of 66 books, grouped into two main divisions: the Old and New Testaments.\r\n\r\nThe Old Testament is composed of:\r\n\r\nPentateuch: Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy\r\nHistorical books: Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther\r\npoetical books: Job, Psalms, Proverbs, Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon\r\nProphetic ledgers: Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel\r\nMinor Prophetic books: Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi\r\n\r\nThe New Testament is composed of:\r\n\r\nGospels: Matthew, Mark, Luke, John\r\nHistory: Acts\r\nPauline Epistles: Romans, 1 Cor, 2 Cor, Gal, Eph, Phil, Col, 1 Thess, 2 Thess, 1 and 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrew\r\nGeneral Epistles: James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude\r\nProphecy: Revelation",
