ier reading.<br>If you read at night or in low-light, activate night mode that darkens the screen and makes reading much easier. His eyes will thank you and your sleep will be more restful.<br><br>7) Easy navigation between books and chapters of the Bible and keyword search.<br><br>All these resources and more, can be used without internet connection.<br><br>It&#39;s the perfect Bible for you! Download now and share the Word of God with his family and friends.<br><br>New Living Translation Bible consists of 66 books, grouped into two main divisions: the Old and New Testaments.<br><br>The Old Testament is composed of:<br><br>Pentateuch: Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy<br>Historical books: Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther<br>poetical books: Job, Psalms, Proverbs, Ecclesiastes, Song of Solomon<br>Prophetic ledgers: Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel<br>Minor Prophetic books: Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi<br><br>The New Testament is composed of:<br><br>Gospels: Matthew, Mark, Luke, John<br>History: Acts<br>Pauline Epistles: Romans, 1 Cor, 2 Cor, Gal, Eph, Phil, Col, 1 Thess, 2 Thess, 1 and 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrew<br>General Epistles: James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude<br>Prophecy: Revelation",
